{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-01-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'BETMGM RETAIL SPORTSBOOK OFFICIALLY OPENS AT NATIONALS PARK IN WASHINGTON, D.C.', 'text': 'WASHINGTON, JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BETMGM AND THE WASHINGTON NATIONALS ANNOUNCED TODAY THE OPENING OF THE FIRST RETAIL SPORTSBOOK CONNECTED TO A MAJOR LEAGUE BASEBALL STADIUM. THE BETMGM SPORTSBOOK AT NATIONALS PARK IS OPEN YEAR-ROUND, PROVIDING SPORTS FANS AN INNOVATIVE ENTERTAINMENT DESTINATION TO WATCH AND WAGER ON GAMES.'}